 # transactional-settings
 
 Small local library. Run `npm test`.
+
+`transact(file, fn, expectedRevision?)` is synchronous: `fn` receives an
+isolated mutable copy of the data and must return a non-thenable value. A
+supplied revision that does not match throws `ConflictError` without invoking
+the callback. Successful transactions increment the revision and replace the
+file atomically via a sibling temporary file and rename.
diff --git a/src/store.mjs b/src/store.mjs
index 52c4626d3f3848f47842dcfad94739a5c0aa918f..9ac47a06527bbb6400746cd93157d2c4f5ec04b3 100644
